  <constraints>
    <constraint source="ADR-022">Virtual PCF pattern preserved. React 16 + Fluent 9 platform-libraries. No bundling regression.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-024">5-field write via applyResolverFields preserved. Extend with auto-detect, don't replace.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-012">Shared lib pattern preserved. Auto-detect logic uses shared primitives (resolveRecordType, buildRecordUrl, applyResolverFields) via @spaarke/ui-components.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Feature preservation: manual refresh button (SRFR-034), auto-refresh (SRFR-035), showVersionFooter (SRFR-034), PolymorphicPicker consumption (SRFR-030/034), CREATE-mode presave bridge (SRFR-032), title semi-bold + low top padding (SRFR-037), Row 2 grid + labels + Name cell (SRFR-039), Row 2 hyperlink WebAPI-based fix (SRFR-043), navigateTo this-binding fix (SRFR-044) — ALL preserved.</constraint>
    <constraint source="src/client/pcf/CLAUDE.md — Version Update Checklist">ALL 7 anchors bumped together (manifest, index.ts, footer BUILD_DATE, solution.xml, Solution ControlManifest, package.json, pack.ps1).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">TypeScript strict mode. Host-safe error handling (never throw to host form).</constraint>
    <constraint source="CLAUDE.md §3">Sub-agent write boundary — ADR-024 amendment deferred to main session; sub-agent cannot write to .claude/.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Never delete AssociationResolver source until Task 6 build succeeds.</constraint>
    <constraint source="XML">description-key attributes MUST NOT contain apostrophes (Dataverse XSD noAposStringType constraint — discovered during import).</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <steps>
    <step order="0" name="Context Check">Verify context &lt; 60%. Read RegardingResolverApp.tsx + AssociationResolver/handlers/RecordSelectionHandler.ts (auto-detect logic to port).</step>
    <step order="1" name="Add auto-detect helpers to RegardingResolverApp.tsx">Add module-level helpers: `detectPrePopulatedParent(catalog)`, `setFormLookupValue`, `setFormTextValue`. Defensive throughout — never throw.</step>
    <step order="2" name="Add auto-detect useEffect to RegardingResolverApp">Wire on-mount effect with `useRef` guard against double-fire. Skip under readOnly. CREATE-mode: setValue path + presave seam. UPDATE-mode: applyRegardingSelection. Populate selectedTarget + notify onRecordTypeChanged.</step>
    <step order="3" name="Update docstrings">Bump docstring header to v1.4.0. Add "# v1.4.0 (SRFR-045 consolidation with AssociationResolver — subgrid auto-detect)" section. Remove HOST-only language.</step>
    <step order="4" name="Manifest description update">Update ControlManifest.Input.xml description-key + entity property description. Also update Solution/.../ControlManifest.xml + Solution/solution.xml description. Avoid apostrophes (XSD constraint).</step>
    <step order="5" name="Version bump — all 7 anchors">Update 1.3.7 → 1.4.0 in: ControlManifest.Input.xml, index.ts CONTROL_VERSION, RegardingResolverApp.tsx BUILD_DATE (2026-07-05), Solution/solution.xml, Solution/Controls/.../ControlManifest.xml, package.json, Solution/pack.ps1.</step>
    <step order="6" name="Tests update">Add 3 new SRFR-045 tests to __tests__/RegardingResolverApp.test.tsx: (a) sprk_regardingmatter pre-populated, (b) sprk_regardingproject pre-populated, (c) no pre-populated → no-op.</step>
    <step order="7" name="Grep verification">Grep for `1.3.7` under `src/client/pcf/RegardingResolver/` (exclude node_modules + out + Solution/bin + stack-chain). Assert zero non-history hits.</step>
    <step order="9.5" name="Quality Gate">Test run + build. If code-review + adr-check are unavailable in sub-agent mode, note deferral to main session review.</step>
    <step order="8" name="Test run">Run `npm test`. Confirm 69 tests pass (66 baseline + 3 new SRFR-045).</step>
    <step order="9" name="Build">Run `npm run build:prod`. Confirm build passes.</step>
    <step order="10" name="Copy bundle + pack solution">Copy `out/controls/RegardingResolver/bundle.js` to solution controls folder. Run `pack.ps1` → `Solution/bin/RegardingResolverSolution_v1.4.0.zip`.</step>
    <step order="11" name="Deploy">Run `pac solution import --path Solution/bin/RegardingResolverSolution_v1.4.0.zip --force-overwrite --publish-changes` against spaarkedev1. Verify via `pac solution list` → 1.4.0.</step>
    <step order="12" name="Delete AssociationResolverSolution from spaarkedev1">`pac solution delete --solution-name AssociationResolverSolution`. Verify: `pac solution list | grep -i Association` returns nothing.</step>
    <step order="13" name="Delete AssociationResolver source">`rm -rf src/client/pcf/AssociationResolver/`. Verify: `ls src/client/pcf/` shows no AssociationResolver.</step>
    <step order="14" name="Update Task Status">Update SRFR-045 status → completed. Update TASK-INDEX.md — add SRFR-045 row.</step>
  </steps>

  <outputs>
    <output type="code">src/client/pcf/RegardingResolver/RegardingResolver/ControlManifest.Input.xml</output>
