  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">`grep -c 'version="1.4.0"' src/client/pcf/RegardingResolver/RegardingResolver/ControlManifest.Input.xml` returns 1.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`grep -R "1.3.7" src/client/pcf/RegardingResolver/ --exclude-dir=node_modules --exclude-dir=out --exclude-dir=bin` returns only history-comment hits (SRFR-044 docstring reference) + stack-chain package.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Auto-detect on mount when sprk_regardingmatter pre-populated → 5 fields written via setValue in CREATE mode → picker state reflects selection.</criterion>
