    <criterion testable="true">No pre-populated lookup → no auto-detect fires → picker starts empty.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">All prior features preserved (manual refresh, auto-refresh, showVersionFooter, Row 2 layout, Name cell, title styling, hyperlink WebAPI-based fix).</criterion>
