  <notes><![CDATA[
Owner clarification post-v1.3.7 that two PCFs are redundant. Consolidate on
RegardingResolver by porting the one worth-keeping AssociationResolver
feature (subgrid auto-detect) and retiring AssociationResolver.
ADR-024 amendment noting v1.4.0 subgrid auto-detect is deferred to main
session per §3 sub-agent write boundary.
Dataverse XSD gotcha discovered on first import: description-key attributes
cannot contain apostrophes (noAposStringType). Reworded "child entity's" to
"child" in both manifests before successful re-import.
  ]]></notes>
</task>
